#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "248_Haruka"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, I heard you can catch <Color:8>Giant Crabs<Color:Default> around here. I'd love to bring one back as a present. You know, to eat!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
msgctxt "260_Kiryu"
msgid "(<Color:8>Giant Crabs<Color:Default>, huh? I'm not sure they'd be a good souvenir... But I guess I could, if it'd make Haruka happy.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "272_Kiryu"
msgid "A <Color:8>Giant Crab<Color:Default>, huh? Wish I knew how to catch one..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Haruka"
msgid "Ooh, I heard a fisherman talking about them! He said you can catch <Color:8>Giant Crabs<Color:Default> 100 to 150 meters from the shore."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh, is that right? That's pretty far out there. What kind of bait do they like?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "308_Haruka"
msgid "Apparently, they like things like <Color:8>Vinegar Squid (Bait)<Color:Default> and <Color:8>Manila Clams<Color:Default>. Oh, and I heard you can catch them with <Color:8>Chili Peppers<Color:Default>, too. Isn't that funny?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "320_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, who knew you were such a crab enthusiast? Well, thanks to you, I feel like I could go out there and catch us a few <Color:8>Giant Crabs<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Kiryu"
msgid "Okay, I'll give it a try."
msgstr "De acuerdo, lo intentaré."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "356_Haruka"
msgid "Yay! Good luck, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "380_Kiryu"
msgid "(Hold on, I don't have any bait.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Haruka"
msgid "Aww, that's too bad..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Kiryu"
msgid "(Not right now.)"
msgstr "(Ahora no)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "416_Haruka"
msgid "Aww, c'mon, let's do some fishing!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "428_Haruka"
msgid "Can you catch a <Color:8>Marlin<Color:Default>, Uncle Kaz? Everyone at Morning Glory likes fish, you know. I bet they'd love to get one of these!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
msgctxt "440_Kiryu"
msgid "(A <Color:8>Marlin<Color:Default>, huh? Could be pretty hard to get home, but if it'll make Haruka happy, I guess I could give it a try...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh. So you want a <Color:8>Marlin<Color:Default> this time, huh? Do you happen to know how to catch one?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "464_Haruka"
msgid "Actually, I do! I heard you can catch them 120 to 150 meters from the shore."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "476_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh, is that right? That's pretty far. What kind of bait do they usually go for?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "488_Haruka"
msgid "Bait? Let me think... Uh... Sorry, Uncle Kaz, I don't remember hearing anything about bait."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "500_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh... The <Color:8>Marlin<Color:Default> must be a hard fish to catch if even you don't know how to catch it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "512_Haruka"
msgid "I'm sorry, Uncle Kaz. I should've done more research."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "524_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, it's all right. You shouldn't be expected to know everything.\\r\nA <Color:8>Marlin<Color:Default>'s going to be a real good challenge."
msgstr ""

